3. Design system (extracted from the screenshots — treat as law)
Canonical tokens — the founder's globals.css from the reference build, to be used verbatim as the starting stylesheet. Earlier drafts of this spec guessed at these values; this file overrides every hex and font mentioned anywhere else in this prompt. Vocabulary mapping for the rest of the spec: "ink / primary text" = --forest; "pine / dark surfaces" = --forest-deep; "ivory / page background" = --cream; "accent" = --lime. The thin styled scrollbars and the lime ::selection in this file are part of the design — keep them.
@import "tailwindcss";

:root {
  --forest: #182772;
  --forest-deep: #0b1f1a;
  --cream: #fbf6f3;
  --lime: #ccff00;
  --muted: #6b7a74;
  --warm: #f3eee9;
  --line: #e6dfd8;
  --sand: #ebe3db;
}

@theme inline {
  --color-forest: var(--forest);
  --color-forest-deep: var(--forest-deep);
  --color-cream: var(--cream);
  --color-lime: var(--lime);
  --color-muted: var(--muted);
  --color-warm: var(--warm);
  --color-line: var(--line);
  --color-sand: var(--sand);
  --font-sans: var(--font-plus-jakarta);
}

html,
body {
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--forest);
}

body {
  font-family: var(--font-plus-jakarta), ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  min-height: 100%;
}

* {
  scrollbar-width: thin;
  scrollbar-color: #c9c0b6 transparent;
}

::selection {
  background: var(--lime);
  color: var(--forest);
}

input,
select,
textarea,
button {
  font-family: inherit;
}

/* Static marketplace map — forest / cream recolor without an external map API */
.realora-map-image {
  filter: saturate(0.72) sepia(0.18) hue-rotate(72deg) brightness(1.04) contrast(1.02);
}
How the tokens are used
Page background --cream; cards white #FFFFFF with 1px --line borders; alt section bands --warm; neutral chips and quiet pills --sand.
Primary text and the wordmark: --forest. Dark surfaces — the NextStepCard, primary buttons, the active sidebar item, the Portal button: --forest-deep with cream/white text.
--lime #ccff00 is the electric accent, used sparingly and always with --forest text on it: CTA buttons (Buy now, Schedule inspection), the active public-nav pill (Buy), the New Listing chip, the current timeline dot, progress highlights.
Secondary text --muted.
Status pills: Complete = bg #DFEDD8, text #2E5B34; In Progress = bg --sand, text --forest; the current timeline step = bg --lime, text --forest; Waiting = bg #F7EBC6, text #7A6420; New = bg --warm, text --forest; Price Cut chip = bg --forest-deep, text white; New Listing chip = bg --lime, text --forest.
Typography
Plus Jakarta Sans for everything. Wordmark: weight 800, all caps, tight letter-spacing (-0.02em). Headings: 700–800, tight tracking. Body/UI: 400/500/600, base 16px; secondary text 14–15px. Eyebrows ("YOUR NEXT STEP", "NEXT DEADLINE", "BUYER") are 12–13px, uppercase, letter-spacing 0.12em.
Geometry & feel
Card radius 20–24px; buttons and pills fully rounded (999px); inputs radius 14px.
Borders: 1px --line on white cards; shadows extremely soft and warm: 0 1px 2px rgba(11,31,26,.04), 0 12px 32px rgba(11,31,26,.05).
Spacing scale 4/8/12/16/24/32/48. Portal content column max-width ~920px; public pages max-width 1320px with 32px gutters.
The overall feel: warm, calm, expensive, uncluttered. Generous whitespace. Nothing glows, nothing gradients except photo overlays.
