8. Quality bar (this is what "flawless" means here)
Pixel-faithful to the screenshots: same layout proportions (portal sidebar ~250px; gallery ratio; card paddings 24px), same copy strings where given, same visual hierarchy.
Fully responsive: ≥1280px as screenshotted; tablet collapses the map/list split to stacked; mobile: sidebar becomes a top bar + bottom tab bar; tables become cards. Nothing may overflow or clip.
Accessibility: semantic landmarks, focus-visible rings (lime outline), AA contrast (lime is never used for small text on ivory), aria-labels on icon buttons, keyboard-navigable dialogs/drawers.
Performance: next/image everywhere, route-level code splitting, no layout shift on the gallery/map.
Code quality: strict TS types for all entities (Listing, Offer, Deal, Task, Milestone, DocumentItem, ServiceVendor, Message), components under /src/components/{public,portal,shared}, no any, no dead code, README section explaining how to swap mock services for real APIs.
Every interactive element works: hearts toggle + persist, filters filter, wizard validates (price > 0, EMD ≤ price, dates sane) with inline errors, toggles persist, Reset demo restores seed.
